@InteriorDesign.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Log in (replace values with your configured admin)
POST {{InteriorDesign.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin@yourstudio.com",
  "password": "your-admin-password"
}

### Use the token returned by login
@token = replace-with-jwt

GET {{InteriorDesign.Api_HostAddress}}/api/images
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List designs
GET {{InteriorDesign.Api_HostAddress}}/api/designs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
